# reproduced from a clone without them. See docs/AOT_VALIDATION_CRITERIA.md.
# Only the CSVs and their README are tracked; working subfolders stay ignored.
!data/historical/
data/historical/*
!data/historical/*.csv
!data/historical/*.md
